annex.point:
1.1.Information to be included in the upper part of the tyre label:

			L_2020177EN.01001601.tif:OTHER

				I. QR code;
				II. Trade name or trademark of the supplier;
				III. Tyre type identifier;
				IV. Tyre size designation, load-capacity index and speed category symbol, as indicated in Regulation No 30 of the Economic Commission for Europe of the United Nations (UN/ECE)
				Regulation No 30 of the Economic Commission for Europe of the United Nations (UN/ECE) – Uniform provisions concerning the approval of pneumatic tyres for motor vehicles and their trailers (OJ L 201, 30.7.2008, p. 70)., in its most up-to-date version applicable to the Union, (UNECE Regulation No 30) and Regulation No 54 of the Economic Commission for Europe of the United Nations (UNECE)Regulation No 54 of the Economic Commission for Europe of the United Nations (UNECE) – Uniform provisions concerning the approval of pneumatic tyres for commercial vehicles and their trailers (OJ L 183, 11.7.2008, p. 41)., in its most up‐to‐date version applicable to the Union, (UNECE Regulation No 54) for C1 tyres, C2 tyres and C3 tyres, as applicable;
				V. Tyre class: i.e. C1, C2 or C3;
				VI. Fuel efficiency pictogram, scale and performance class;
				VII. Wet grip pictogram, scale and performance class.

1.3.Information to be included in the bottom part of the tyre label for tyres which satisfy the minimum snow grip index values set out in UNECE Regulation No 117:

			L_2020177EN.01001702.tif:OTHER

				I. External rolling noise pictogram, value (expressed in dB(A) and rounded to the nearest integer) and performance class;
				II. Snow grip pictogram;
				III. The serial number of this Regulation: ‘2020/740’.

1.4.Information to be included in the bottom part of the tyre label for tyres which satisfy the relevant minimum ice grip index values:

			L_2020177EN.01001703.tif:OTHER

				I. External rolling noise pictogram, value (expressed in dB(A) and rounded to the nearest integer) and performance class;
				II. Ice grip pictogram;
				III. The serial number of this Regulation: ‘2020/740’.

1.5.Information to be included in the bottom part of the tyre label for tyres which satisfy both the relevant minimum snow grip index values set out in UNECE Regulation No 117 and the minimum ice grip index values:

			L_2020177EN.01001801.tif:OTHER

				I. External rolling noise pictogram, value (expressed in dB(A) and rounded to the nearest integer) and performance class;
				II. Snow grip pictogram;
				III. Ice grip pictogram;
				IV. The serial number of this Regulation: ‘2020/740’.

point.indent:
— colours of the EU logo as follows:
				— background: 100,80,0,0;
				— stars: 0,0,100,0;

— CMYK colour codes of arrows for the A to E fuel efficiency scale as follows:
				— A-class: 100,0,100,0;
				— B-class: 45,0,100,0;
				— C-class: 0,0,100,0;
				— D-class: 0,30,100,0;
				— E-class: 0,100,100,0;

— CMYK colour codes of arrows for the A to E wet grip scale as follows:
				— A: 100,60,0,0;
				— B: 90,40,0,0;
				— C: 65,20,0,0;
				— D: 50,10,0,0;
				— E: 30,0,0,0;
